    {
      "order": 3,
      "depth": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "Moolavar: Sri Mukti Narayana Perumal\nThayaar: Sridevi Nachiyar\nVimanam: Kanaka Vimanam\nPushkarani: Chakra Theertham / Sahasradhaare\n\nTravel: To reach this kshethram, one must travel to Pokhara, Nepal. From Pokhara, they must fly to Jomsom. From Jomsom, they will have to get to the temple by mini-bus / van.\n\nAzhwar Pasuram:\nTirumangai Azhwar: 10 pasuram\nPeriya Azhwar: 2 Pasurams\nTotal: 12 Pasurams",
      "textFontSizeHint": 16
    },
