    {
      "order": 9,
      "depth": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "Sthala Puranam:\nAccording to legend, it is said that Gandaki Nadi performed tapas to the Lord. When the Lord appeared before her, she asked that He stay in her womb always. The Lord told her that, as she is a river, her riverbed represents her womb. He told her that He would reside in the stones at the bottom of the river in the form of Shalagramam. To date, whenever a devotee visits this kshethram, they take back with them the various kinds of shalagramams.\n",
      "textFontSizeHint": 16
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "depth": 1,
      "type": "picture",
      "imageAssetRef": "ag-asset://f4d98aaa-ad7b-4987-b9f6-5c450ca94928"
